msgstr "停止"

msgid "Switching directories while the server runs restarts it automatically when no transfer is active; otherwise restart it manually later."
msgstr "服务运行中切换目录：无进行中的传输时自动重启，否则请稍后手动重启。"

msgid "TftpdR · TFTP server"
msgstr "TftpdR · TFTP 服务端"

msgid "The R in TftpdR stands for Rust. This is a read-only TFTP server; the daemon and the desktop panel share one protocol core and one set of configuration rules."
msgstr "TftpdR 中的 R 代表 Rust。这是一个只读 TFTP 服务端，守护进程与桌面面板共享同一套协议内核与配置校验规则。"

msgid "The standard port 69 needs administrator/root; without permission use an unprivileged port such as 6969."
msgstr "标准端口 69 需要管理员/root；无权限时请改用 6969 等非特权端口。"

msgid "These are this machine's interface addresses. A port without permission is reported when the server starts."
msgstr "显示的是本机网卡地址，权限不足的端口会在启动时给出提示。"

msgid "Timeout (s)"
msgstr "超时（秒）"

msgid "Transfers"
msgstr "传输列表"

msgid "Uses the same TOML validation rules as the daemon. Saving restarts a running server automatically when no transfer is active; otherwise restart it manually later."
msgstr "与守护进程使用同一套 TOML 校验规则。保存后，运行中且无传输时自动重启；否则请稍后手动重启。"

msgid "Version {}"
msgstr "版本 {}"

msgid "WARN only"
msgstr "仅 WARN"
